                            {
                                "target_word": "possessed",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "a7838b7e-e414-3dbe-a9dc-55e59d6c3215",
                                        "entry_id": "14379717-da16-3a29-bf39-f133c3ace60e",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "controlled by evil spirits."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "9ea3577e-077c-433a-b1dc-25cf24cab6d5",
                                                "sense_id": "a7838b7e-e414-3dbe-a9dc-55e59d6c3215",
                                                "text": "He was exorcised because he was thought to be possessed by the Devil."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "f5c7ab1a-801c-4bf3-bbff-db8c61afa8bb",
                                                "sense_id": "a7838b7e-e414-3dbe-a9dc-55e59d6c3215",
                                                "text": "Three days remained till Beltane's E'en, and throughout this time it was noted that Heriotside behaved like one possessed. It may be that his conscience pricked him, or that he had a glimpse of his sin and its coming punishment."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "f05919a4-9b8b-309b-9702-901a385010a9",
                                        "entry_id": "14379717-da16-3a29-bf39-f133c3ace60e",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Seized by powerful emotions."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "595330cb-99f7-4864-9da5-656ed49cfeb0",
                                                "sense_id": "f05919a4-9b8b-309b-9702-901a385010a9",
                                                "text": "O what ridiculous Reſolutions Men take, when poſſeſs'd with Fear! It deprives them of the Uſe of thoſe Means which Reaſon offers for their Relief."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "5a056df7-f719-32d0-a8a8-9eac9133cbaf",
                                        "entry_id": "14379717-da16-3a29-bf39-f133c3ace60e",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Followed by of: having; owning."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "not-comparable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "1c016861-1e58-4213-a608-d892de264703",
                                                "sense_id": "5a056df7-f719-32d0-a8a8-9eac9133cbaf",
                                                "text": "The president was possessed of great wealth."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "8750e5ed-873a-4406-89ea-b83ab8b2fa77",
                                                "sense_id": "5a056df7-f719-32d0-a8a8-9eac9133cbaf",
                                                "text": "It is said that every life has its roses and thorns; there seemed, however, to have been a misadventure or mistake in Stephen's case, whereby somebody else had become possessed of his roses, and he had become possessed of the same somebody else's thorns in addition to his own."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "bb167cf1-413c-486d-9ba7-cfd22588a36b",
                        "source_entry_id": "eb4b4910-633f-3938-ab60-8ca7a815e43e",
                        "source_sense_id": "64b9a88d-2ed6-3b9b-9f07-08ccecafc981",
                        "source_sense_description": "onder de invloed van een boze geest zijn",
                        "target_lang_word": "possédé",
                        "target_lang_code": "fr",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "possédé",
                                "target_lang_code": "fr",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "9c614059-12fa-3005-9492-46c80676703f",
                                        "entry_id": "cd6c412b-d997-314d-a46f-e4ba51d1ed88",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Qualifie un être vivant dominé par une puissance maléfique ou occulte."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "47ffcfe0-4047-4f7c-91f7-c88696c5a8e1",
                                                "sense_id": "9c614059-12fa-3005-9492-46c80676703f",
                                                "text": "Le Père Cipriano de Meo avait exorcisé un jeune homme possédé par le démon"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "possédé",
                                "target_lang_code": "fr",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "7435f29f-ae1f-3b6d-9fe0-1026de098982",
                                        "entry_id": "0006935c-6e0b-3cd7-972f-054054b7f0e2",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Personne dont le démon s’est emparé."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "c30f0d30-bb0f-4235-b365-7721ca7bf3c8",
                                                "sense_id": "7435f29f-ae1f-3b6d-9fe0-1026de098982",
                                                "text": "Un possédé... un possédé... C'est un exorciste qu'il lui faudrait...."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "83f80fcf-249e-42c7-9c97-2a61f4d2cd7d",
                                                "sense_id": "7435f29f-ae1f-3b6d-9fe0-1026de098982",
                                                "text": "D’autres viennent d’Angola. De véritables buffles, ceux-là, forts en gueule et prompts à la bagarre. Une fois, j’ai dû en corriger un qui s’était enivré de fangourin. On aurait dit un véritable possédé. Il porte encore la marque de mon couteau sur son visage. Depuis ce jour, je m’en méfie comme de la gale, et jamais je ne lui tourne le dos."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "possédé",
                                "target_lang_code": "fr",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "110e3839-4e48-3ece-9f98-e49d81f0adff",
                                        "entry_id": "cb8664a6-b596-3f9e-bb3d-beed0fb58830",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Ce qui est possédé dans une possession grammaticale. Dans mon livre, un livre à moi et j’ai un livre, le possédé est livre et le possesseur est moi."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "7047f72a-e72f-4e31-8c0f-b2a424c46901",
                                                "sense_id": "110e3839-4e48-3ece-9f98-e49d81f0adff",
                                                "text": "Le syntagme génitival, comme plus généralement les constructions couramment désignées par les linguistes comme “possessives”, renvoie fondamentalement à la notion de participation d’une entité (conventionnellement désignée comme le possédé) à la sphère personnelle d’un individu (conventionnellement désigné comme le possesseur) : les constructions possessives sont des structures syntaxiques dont l’emploi a pour fondement la possibilité d’assimiler la relation entre les référents de deux termes à la relation entre un individu et un élément de la sphère personnelle de cet individu."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "possédé",
                                "target_lang_code": "fr",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "c7eb0819-a7d9-3459-bfc2-79281eec629d",
